{"about_the_game":"Man &amp; Dog is a hunting simulation game situated in Finland. Together with your companion dog, use real Nordic hunting methods to seek grouse bird hiding in the trees, or get into a thrilling chase with a fox or rabbit. Immerse yourself in authentic Finnish wilderness in autumm or winter. <br><br><br>Tree top bird hunting in winter or autumm<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.poster.avif?t=1754230468\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.webm?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/9a0e62b95eab8aa3c2669c83db989372.mp4?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The dog will try to point the correct tree where a bird is<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.poster.avif?t=1754230468\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.webm?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/97ce81f669f502d3b4024b85589a14df.mp4?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Keep an eye on the dog's path, and listen for barking<br>Dont get too excited, it could just be barking at a squirrell!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.poster.avif?t=1754230468\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.webm?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/57ef1f8b5a548e9be1f32207af7400cc.mp4?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Use foliage as cover and move carefully,  prey are elusive<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.poster.avif?t=1754230468\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.webm?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/319999b88a276287571b328d4b915db5.mp4?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> Get a clear shot, branches might deflect bullets<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.poster.avif?t=1754230468\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.webm?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794480/extras/63830487d5cbd1f2b1ee1ddabb69cbc2.mp4?t=1754230468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience atmospheric black grouse swamp hunting <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it